    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_building_3",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Luckily I did some warm up back in Chernobog. But really, I didn't even break a sweat handling you guys.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You! You Rhodes Islander, you're a disgrace to all Infected. How could you turn on your own like this just to help Lungmen?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you'll hand us over to them, as if that keeps your hands clean? Bullshit! How do you live with yourself?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "You ate two punches, cracked your skull on the pavement and you've still got the energy to talk trash? Not bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you've got it all wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmf!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Having trouble breathing? Feel like your lungs are on fire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ack... Guh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It starts in your sinuses, then crawls down your windpipe, until it finally finds a home there in your diaphragm. All I have to do is wiggle my little finger and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "A stream of superheated air will shoot into your body, expand, ignite your organs, and erupt out of your pores.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "The funny thing is, Lungmen might let you live. But me and my little finger...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aah! Gaaah...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Won't leave any of you breathing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nooooo! L-let me go! Please!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#8",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. I'll be merciful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Officer! Over here. You take care of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "And one more thing, my new Ursus buddy. You think next time you could actually make me break a sweat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, they made it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You were amazing!;......;You're certainly making a lot of noise.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. That was nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about next time I show you how to snap an arm 90 degrees without breaking the bone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, what's with that face...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long have you been at Rhodes Island? You're acting like you've never seen a fight before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Compared to them, I'm a regular softie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "But of course. You think I'm the type to play it low-key?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can put the fear of Blaze into them, who knows how many others might just give up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to play it up to make all my hard work worth something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's not steer the Doctor astray...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Bunny!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't just scoop me up like a toy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're just so soft...! Hey! Stop struggling! Just let it happen. I promise I won't bite!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze... Stop... Can't... Breathe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've only been apart for an hour! What's with you! Get serious!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I take it back. You're not cute.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's enough...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#10",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Woah, hey, I was just playing! Get out of my head! I can't take you screwing around with my emotions again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's here with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, I'm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know who you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talk to my fellow Infected like that again and I'll tear out your throat myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's the way it is. And she deserves a warning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm out. Rendezvous at the next waypoint.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "GreyThroat, Blaze may have misunderstood you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine. I really did say those things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She shouldn't be dredging up your past to attack the person you are today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knows? Have I really changed? Even I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You'll need to do something to find it out then.;......;Can we really have you running ops right now?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm here because I wanted to do something. No matter what that Blaze says.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "(Amiya...)",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Right... She's not Infected, so GreyThroat might not grasp the reality of Rhodes Island's current situation.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(This operation could force her to decide once and for all... if she's going to stay or leave.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But she's gotten used to taking orders, and doesn't speak up much. Sometimes she does surprise, though...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(There's no malice in her heart. She just needs a chance to find herself.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Still, she's strong and reliable. You can trust her, Doctor. And even if we can't help her, I know she can help you.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... where did Gavial go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Got too excited and went to crack some skulls?;......;Probably went to do frivolous collateral damage.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "She can't do that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a minute, who taught you to think of her like that, Doctor? I mean, it's kind of true, but still...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't afford to make mistakes here. Hurry to the next waypoint and try to signal her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if she's operating according to plan, there'll be trouble if no one's watching her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What about the other teams?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got elite operators acting as squad leaders. They'll report in. Don't worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We stand at a crucial point in this joint operation. This is the decisive battle for Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What about Superintendent Ch'en?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_6_21",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She has her own mission to command.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Superintendent Ch'en, as Chief of the Special Inspection Unit, will be deploying the best the L. G. D. has to offer against Reunion in service of our joint plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the same time, she has to herd Reunion's main force to the target location, all while keeping any of their smaller teams from slipping into the slums.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_6_22",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And we, Rhodes Island, will keep moving through the waypoints on our patrol route, mopping up Reunion's squads along the way, pushing them to give up the fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally, we'll reach the target location at the slums and, together with the L. G. D., we'll deliver the decisive blow to Reunion's main force.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Considering the scale, there's relatively little Rhodes Island can do. But we'll execute the plan to the best of our abilities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for the issues that have come up in the course of our cooperation with the L. G. D.... Dr. {@nickname}, I promise to answer all our people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Doctor, there is something only you can do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Leave it to me!;......;Should I be taking this more seriously?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's not the kind of thing you'll have to put so much effort into.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now's not the time to clam up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you waiting for me to say more?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could at least tell me what you're thinking, Doctor...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that's okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't the kind of thing you need to be so solemn about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to call up Blaze and have her look after you. And for the little while until we meet up again, I need you to look after her too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Me look after her? Have you seen me?;......;I can protect an elite operator? News to me.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... I'm not talking about like in battle! I mean look after her psychology.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know Rhodes Island has to fight the Infected sometimes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Especially right now. Our cooperation with Lungmen has led to some friction.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze is one of the elite operators we rely on for survival, yes, but her psychological state has an impact on her performance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is because she is so resolutely committed to our mission that her encounters with the Infected have the potential to influence her emotions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on, Doctor. Treat it as an opportunity to learn what makes her tick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Show your appreciation for her. Thank her for saving you back there. She'll eat it up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Good idea!;......;Is that really necessary?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe in you, Doctor! Go get 'em!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
