    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Their main force is engaging our other teams!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will reach the target location ahead of Reunion and join the formation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell them we need to eliminate all Reunion elements that have not joined up with their main force first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Got it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do what Superintendent Ch'en just said! Over and out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How long has it been since we fought together like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't say we're 'fighting together' now. It's more like we're 'co-belligerents.' How did you get back here anyway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got my own motor pool, of course. How else do you think I saved Rhodes Island? Now what's got your panties in a twist? I can tell you're upset.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm. Let me think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You need to think about it! Look at you looking for reasons to be mad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right. You went behind my back to save Rhodes Island. You could have told me in private.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Was that embarrassing for you? Or you just don't like being kept in the dark?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Both.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wowee... since when are you so direct? My old Officer Ch'en would talk herself in circles for hours...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eyes forward!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "L. G. D. defender squad, shields up! Play it just like we have a million times before. And never forget, your brothers and sisters are right behind you! Stand firm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crossbows, nock!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They blocked this road too? Uh oh... there's nowhere to go! We're trapped!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, we can break them! With me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guards, ready!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Overrun them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crossbows, first volley, fire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pikes up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let a single one of them out of our city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
