    },
    {
        "text": "Wei, old boy, we're brothers, of a sort, aren't we...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I'm asking you, for the sake of my daughter and her mother...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, should I even have to ask? Would you really refuse to help your own sister?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already decided on a name for my daughter. We'll call her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Talulah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't take it to heart. I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all very clear to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
